# UI

- Use existing tokens: `bg-ink`, `text-cream`, `text-gold`, `font-display`, `card`, `btn-gold`.
- Read data through `@/lib/content`. Do not duplicate address or menu arrays in JSX.
- New pages belong under `src/app/<route>/page.tsx` and must be added to `content/business.json` `nav` if they are public.
- Keep layouts simple. This brand is a late-night stone-oven bakery, not a luxury cafe.

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
const phone = primaryPhone();
<a href={telHref(phone)}>{phone.display}</a>

// ❌ BAD
<a href="tel:0508777464">050-877-7464</a>
```
